OL,3,GNEWSACriminals target students in cash
OL,4,Afor parcels scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FCriminals are offering people cash to
OL,7,Ftake in parcels containing drugs,
OL,8,Fweapons and stolen goods, in what West
OL,9,FYorkshire Police have described as a
OL,10,F"growing trend".
OL,12,FThe force said gangs were targeting
OL,13,Fstudents and vulnerable people via
OL,14,Fsocial media, encouraging them to
OL,15,Faccept packages on their behalf in
OL,16,Fexchange for money.
OL,18,FA police spokesperson anyone caught
OL,19,Faccepting a parcel could be prosecuted
OL,20,Ffor possession of controlled drugs,
OL,21,Fhanding stolen goods or money
OL,22,Flaundering.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
